---
description: Requirements for Express, Prisma, auth, API, algorithms and test coverage
alwaysApply: false
globs: ["server/**", "schemas/**"]
---
- API contract: `docs/06-API-CONTRACT.md`.
- Validate body and query parameters with Zod. Make response shapes and status codes consistent.
- DB interactions via Prisma only; use migrations; document seed and reset commands.
- Never query PostgreSQL from the browser; never trust `role`, `patientId`, or `verified` fields supplied by the client.
- Isolate AHP and scoring into pure functions with independent unit tests and strict numerical validation (positive reciprocal matrix, CR, NaN, zero denominator, missing scores).
- Protect all mutation routes with session, CSRF/origin strategy and server-side access checks; use transactions for linked writes.
- Append versioned algorithm metadata to saved recommendations and ensure deterministic tie-breaking.
